menu "Wireless Link Configuration"

    config WLINK_CHANNEL
        int "Wi-Fi channel used by the bridge link"
        range 1 13
        default 1
        help
            Both devices of a wireless bridge pair must use the same channel.
            The channel is fixed at start-up instead of following the station
            configuration, so the link also works when no access point is around.

    config WLINK_SWD_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "CMSIS-DAP response timeout (ms)"
        default 250
        help
            How long the wireless host waits for a DAP response from the slave
            before retransmitting the request.

    config WLINK_SWD_RETRIES
        int "CMSIS-DAP request retransmissions"
        range 1 10
        default 3
        help
            Number of times a DAP request is (re)sent before the relay gives up.
            Giving up lets OpenOCD time out and retry at a higher level.

endmenu
